zl-agent (1.0.1-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Prompt edge, its bottom stub and the spinner now use the ZealLab brand
    blue instead of the rotating per-agent colour.
  * Logo background squares tint toward main_blue rather than the text
    colour.
  * "/connect" lists the models the local Ollama daemon actually has,
    instead of opening the cloud provider authentication dialog.
  * The models.dev cloud provider catalog is no longer compiled into the
    binary, so no cloud providers can be offered.

 -- ZealLab LLC <info@zeallab.com>  Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:34:15 -0400

zl-agent (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Adds the "zl agent" subcommand: a local AI coding
    agent backed by Ollama.

